---
title: Cake Mix Brownies
servings: 16
cuisine: american
main_protein: none
prep_time: "10 minutes"
cook_time: "20 minutes"
tags:
  - dessert
  - chocolate
  - cakemix
  - brownies
source: https://buildyourbite.com/cake-mix-brownies-recipe/#wprm-recipe-container-15628
image: ../obsidian/attachments/cake-mix-brownies.jpg
leftover_portions: 12
prep:
  - Preheat oven to 350°F
  - Grease an 8x8 baking dish
---
Combine @chocolate cake mix{15%oz}, @oil{0.5%cup}, @eggs{2}, @vanilla extract{1%tbsp}, and @semi-sweet chocolate chips{1%cup} in a #bowl{}. Mix with a #rubber spatula{} until well combined.

Transfer batter to a greased #8x8 baking dish{}. Flatten and smooth the batter using the spatula.

Bake at 350°F for ~{20%minutes}, or until a toothpick inserted comes out clean.

Allow brownies to cool completely before cutting.

-- Duncan Hines Dark Chocolate Fudge cake mix recommended; any olive, vegetable, or neutral cooking oil works.
